  "description": "Hae-Sung and Ji-Woon were childhood friends that grew apart after Ji-Woon moved away. Reunited at college years later, the friendship is rekindled - but there’s no sexual chemistry to speak of. However, that all changes when Hae-Sung catches a glimpse of Ji-Woon’s package as he’s getting dressed. After the “big” reveal, Hae-Sung begins to view her hunky childhood friend in a new light!.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes ten extra chapters.*",
